| `evidence.run_date.env` | string | `KEEL_GATE_RUN_DATE` | an environment variable name that `child_env.names` lists | `scripts/run_date.py`; `scripts/gate_evidence.py`; `scripts/jobs/review_docs.py` (`resolve_today`); `scripts/check_structure.py` (check X) | Renames the variable in which the gate's driver hands every goal the date the run began; a name `child_env.names` does not list is a check X error and, at run time, is refused with exit 14 by `scripts/gate_evidence.py` and exit 2 by `scripts/jobs/review_docs.py`, and removing `evidence.run_date` makes every check read the clock and its reader write `[using default] evidence.run_date = null` to stderr. | pinning a reproducible build's date: `SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH` | always |
